# Custom Monaco formula-editor component (frontend)
# Ignore installed dependencies, but DO track the built bundle: Streamlit Cloud
# serves the committed build and never runs `npm install`/`npm run build`.
# The generic `build/` rule above would otherwise hide it, so re-include it here.
molecular_calculator/components/formula_editor/frontend/node_modules/
!molecular_calculator/components/formula_editor/frontend/build/
!molecular_calculator/components/formula_editor/frontend/build/**


